.Dd February 11, 2026
.Dt VOP_IOCTL 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vop_ioctl
.Nd perform a vnode ioctl operation
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In sys/param.h
.In vfs/vnode.h
.Ft int
.Fn vop_ioctl "struct vnode *vp" "uint32_t command" "void *data" "int fflag" "struct ucred *cred"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn vop_ioctl
wrapper dispatches control requests to filesystem or device-specific
ioctl handlers associated with the vnode.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns 0 on success, or an error number.
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width "[EOPNOTSUPP]"
.It Bq Er EOPNOTSUPP
The vnode has no ioctl handler.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vnode 9 ,
.Xr vop_poll 9
